   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Known or sought relative",
     "texto": [
      "With an identified antecedent the indicative is used: **J'ai trouvé une solution qui est efficace**. If an unidentified or desired option is sought, the subjunctive is common: **Je cherche une solution qui soit efficace**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlatives and «le seul»",
     "texto": [
      "After a superlative or expressions such as **le seul**, the subjunctive is common when a value judgment is expressed: **C'est le meilleur article que j'aie lu**. If the subject of both actions is the same, the infinitive can be used: **Je cherche un article à lire**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
